The Functional and Performance Testing phase ensures that “ToyCraft Tales: Tableau's Vision into Toy Manufacturer Data” works correctly and efficiently.

Functional testing verifies that all features such as database operations, SQL queries, data connection, and Tableau dashboards are working as expected.

Performance testing checks the system’s speed, responsiveness, and ability to handle large datasets without errors or delays.

This phase ensures accuracy, reliability, and smooth performance of the final analytical solution.
